# 统一按 LF 存入库、且在 Windows 上检出时也保持 LF，
# 避免 LICENSE / COPYING.LESSER 等法律文本与官方原文行尾不一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.lib  binary

# Rust 源码：diff 时按 Rust 语法高亮
*.rs diff=rust
